<title>EGYPT: Egypt switches to winter time.</title>
<headline>Egypt switches to winter time.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt switched to winter time at midnight on Thursday (2200 GMT), turning the clocks back by one hour, Egyptian television said on Friday.</p>
<p>Egyptian winter time is two hours ahead of GMT.</p>
</text>
